"title": "Passive Voice - Past Simple (المبني للمجهول - الماضي البسيط)",
"headers": ["المعلوم (Active)", "المجهول (Passive)"],
"rows": [
["Subject + Verb (past) + Object", "Object + was/were + V3 + by + Subject"],
["The teacher rewarded the students.", "The students were rewarded by the teacher."],
["Newton discovered laws of motion.", "Laws of motion were discovered by Newton."],
["The factory bought new machinery.", "New machinery was bought by the factory."],
["A storm destroyed many places.", "Many places were destroyed by a storm."]
],
"explanation": "المبني للمجهول في الماضي البسيط يتكون من: الفاعل + was/were + التصريف الثالث (V3) + by + المفعول به (الفاعل في المعلوم).",
"examples": "The students were rewarded by the teacher. / Laws of motion were discovered by Newton."
},
